<?xml version="1.0"?>
<h:html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:h="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:jr="http://openrosa.org/javarosa" xmlns:orx="http://openrosa.org/xforms" xmlns:odk="http://www.opendatakit.org/xforms">
  <h:head>
    <h:title>Diabetes</h:title>
    <model odk:xforms-version="1.0.0">
      <instance>
        <data id="ADT_FormX_Diabetes" version="20260829181611" prefix="J1!ADT_FormX_Diabetes!" delimiter="#">
          <inputs>
            <meta>
              <location>
                <lat/>
                <long/>
                <error/>
                <message/>
              </location>
            </meta>
            <source>user</source>
            <source_id/>
            <user>
              <contact_id/>
              <parent>
                <_id/>
              </parent>
            </user>
            <contact>
              <_id/>
              <name/>
              <short_name/>
              <patient_id/>
              <date_of_birth>0</date_of_birth>
              <sex/>
              <parent>
                <_id/>
                <parent>
                  <contact>
                    <nurse_name/>
                    <phone/>
                  </contact>
                </parent>
              </parent>
            </contact>
          </inputs>
          <source/>
          <source_id/>
          <patient_uuid/>
          <patient_id/>
          <patient_name/>
          <patient_short_name/>
          <patient_sex/>
          <patient_date_of_birth/>
          <patient_age_in_years/>
          <patient_age_in_months/>
          <patient_age_in_days/>
          <patient_age_in_weeks/>
          <diabetes_checkup_group>
            <diabetes_symptoms/>
            <hereditary_diabetes/>
            <blood_glucose/>
            <time_of_last_meal/>
          </diabetes_checkup_group>
          <results_group>
            <calc_hyperglycemia_mild/>
            <calc_hyperglycemia_moderate/>
            <calc_hyperglycemia_severe/>
            <res_hyperglycemia_mild/>
            <res_hyperglycemia_mild_action/>
            <res_hyperglycemia_moderate/>
            <res_hyperglycemia_moderate_action/>
            <res_hyperglycemia_severe/>
            <res_hyperglycemia_severe_action/>
          </results_group>
          <meta tag="hidden">
            <instanceID/>
          </meta>
        </data>
      </instance>
      <instance id="contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="user-contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="yes_no">
        <root>
          <item>
            <name>yes</name>
            <label>Yes</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>no</name>
            <label>No</label>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <instance id="diabetes_symptoms">
        <root>
          <item>
            <name>tiredness</name>
            <label>Appears tired or lethargic</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>weight_loss</name>
            <label>Experienced weight loss</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>frequent_urination</name>
            <label>Frequent urination</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>frequent_eating</name>
            <label>Wants to eat a lot</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>frequent_drinking</name>
            <label>Drinks a lot</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>excessive_sweating</name>
            <label>Excessive sweating / night sweats</label>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs" relevant="./source = 'user'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/user/contact_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/user/parent/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/_id" type="db:person"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/short_name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/patient_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/date_of_birth" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/sex" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact/nurse_name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact/phone" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/source" type="string" calculate="../inputs/source"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/source_id" type="string" calculate="../inputs/source_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_uuid" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_id" type="string" required="true()" calculate="../inputs/contact/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_name" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/name"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_short_name" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/short_name"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_sex" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/sex"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_date_of_birth" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/date_of_birth"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_years" type="string" calculate="floor( difference-in-months(  /data/patient_date_of_birth , today() ) div 12 )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_months" type="string" calculate="difference-in-months(  /data/patient_date_of_birth , today() )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_days" type="string" calculate="floor( decimal-date-time(today()) - decimal-date-time( /data/patient_date_of_birth ) )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_weeks" type="string" calculate="floor((decimal-date-time(today()) - decimal-date-time( /data/patient_date_of_birth )) div 7)"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/diabetes_symptoms" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/hereditary_diabetes" type="string" required="true()"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/blood_glucose" type="int" required="true()" relevant="count-selected( /data/diabetes_checkup_group/diabetes_symptoms ) &gt; 0" constraint=". &lt;= 999"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/time_of_last_meal" type="dateTime" required="true()" relevant="count-selected( /data/diabetes_checkup_group/diabetes_symptoms ) &gt; 0" constraint="decimal-date-time(.) &gt;= decimal-date-time(today()) - 3" jr:constraintMsg="Cannot be more than 3 days prior to today."/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_mild" type="string" calculate="if( /data/diabetes_checkup_group/blood_glucose  &gt;= 120 and  /data/diabetes_checkup_group/blood_glucose  &lt;= 200, 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_moderate" type="string" calculate="if( /data/diabetes_checkup_group/blood_glucose  &gt; 200 and  /data/diabetes_checkup_group/blood_glucose  &lt;= 400, 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_severe" type="string" calculate="if( /data/diabetes_checkup_group/blood_glucose  &gt; 400, 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_mild" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_mild  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_mild_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_mild  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_moderate" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_moderate  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_moderate_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_moderate  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_severe" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_severe  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_severe_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_hyperglycemia_severe  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/instanceID" type="string" readonly="true()" jr:preload="uid"/>
    </model>
  </h:head>
  <h:body class="pages">
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/inputs">
      <label>NO_LABEL</label>
      <group ref="/data/inputs/user">
        <label>User</label>
        <input ref="/data/inputs/user/contact_id" appearance="select-contact type-person">
          <label>Contact ID</label>
        </input>
        <group ref="/data/inputs/user/parent">
          <label>NO_LABEL</label>
        </group>
      </group>
      <group ref="/data/inputs/contact">
        <label>NO_LABEL</label>
        <input ref="/data/inputs/contact/_id" appearance="db-object">
          <label>What is the patient's name?</label>
        </input>
        <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent">
          <label>NO_LABEL</label>
          <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent">
            <label>NO_LABEL</label>
            <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact">
              <label>NO_LABEL</label>
            </group>
          </group>
        </group>
      </group>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/diabetes_checkup_group">
      <label>Diabetes Checkup</label>
      <select ref="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/diabetes_symptoms">
        <label>Is the patient experiencing any of the following symptoms?</label>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('diabetes_symptoms')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select>
      <select1 ref="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/hereditary_diabetes">
        <label>Do any of the patient's relatives have diabetes?</label>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('yes_no')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select1>
      <input ref="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/blood_glucose">
        <label>Blood glucose value measured by diabetes finger prick test (mg/dL):</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/diabetes_checkup_group/time_of_last_meal">
        <label>When did the patient last eat?</label>
      </input>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/results_group">
      <label>Results</label>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_mild">
        <label>Hyperglycemia</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_mild_action">
        <label>The patient is hyperglycemic. 

Protocol: 
Counseling
-Explain that the blood sugar is higher than normal but is not dangerously high. 
-If measurement was after a meal, request to come back to following kwen Sante Pam without having eaten for a repeat test to confirm diabetes or not

Advise the patient to:
-Eat regular meals and avoid skipping meals. 
-Reduce foods and drinks with added sugar, including soft drinks, sweetened juices, candies, cakes, and pastries. 
-Limit large portions of rice, bread, pasta, and other refined starches. 
-Choose whole grains, beans, vegetables, and fresh fruit. 
-Include lean protein (beans, fish, eggs, poultry) with meals. 
-Avoid excessive fried and fatty foods</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_moderate">
        <label>Diabetes - Hyperglycemia</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_moderate_action">
        <label>The patient has diabetes. 

Protocol:
-Metformin, newly diagnosed type 2 diabetes, 500 mg with breakfast during one week 
-If well tolerated, 500 mg twice daily with meals and then back for blood glucose test,
-If glycaemic control remains inadequate after 1–2 weeks, 
increase by 500 mg per week
Increase by 500 mg/day each week as tolerated

Maintenance
1,000 mg twice daily 
(maximum 2 g/day)

Counseling – see above and leaflet</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_severe">
        <label>Diabetes - Hyperglycemia</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_hyperglycemia_severe_action">
        <label>The patient has diabetes and extreme hyperglycemia. 

Protocol:
Refer</label>
      </input>
    </group>
  </h:body>
</h:html>